                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I really enjoyed this game, definitely one of my favourite roguelikes that I have played in some time.\n\nLove the super metroid style, and I really enjoyed the music too.\n\nI enjoyed some of the areas and designs of the bosses and enemies, and the progression power-ups and non-progression power-ups are very fun to use. It's exciting to see what type of weapons you will get during a run.\n\nBut I do wish there were some more enemies and a greater variety of areas. You do end up seeing the same areas over and over again, and I do wish there were a couple more room layouts.\n\nOverall, it's a great game.",
